# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3. Basics of Quantum Phase Estimation (QPE) {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-estimation-qpe}"
msgstr "3. 量子位相推定（QPE）の基礎 {#3-basics-of-quantum-phase-estimation-qpe}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Given a unitary operation $U$, the QPE estimates $\\theta$ in $U\\vert\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$ since $U$ is unitary, all of its eigenvalues have a norm of 1.\n"
msgstr "ユニタリ演算 $U$ が与えられたとき、QPE は $U\\vert\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$ における $\\theta$ を推定します。$U$ はユニタリであるため、その固有値はすべてノルムが 1 です。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.1 Procedure {#31-procedure}"
msgstr "3.1 手順 {#31-procedure}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Setup {#1-setup}"
msgstr "1. 準備 {#1-setup}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ is in one set of qubit registers. An additional set of $n$ qubits form the counting register on which we will store the value $2^n\\theta$:\n"
msgstr "$\\vert\\psi\\rangle$ は一組の量子ビットレジスタに格納されます。追加の $n$ 量子ビットからなるカウンティングレジスタに、値 $2^n\\theta$ を記録します：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_0\\rangle = \\lvert 0 \\rangle^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2. Superposition {#2-superposition}"
msgstr "2. 重ね合わせ {#2-superposition}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a $n$-bit Hadamard gate operation $H^{\\otimes n}$ on the counting register:\n"
msgstr "カウンティングレジスタに $n$ ビットのアダマールゲート演算 $H^{\\otimes n}$ を適用します：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\psi_1\\rangle = {\\frac {1}{2^{\\frac {n}{2}}}}\\left(|0\\rangle +|1\\rangle \\right)^{\\otimes n} \\lvert \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3. Controlled Unitary operations {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"
msgstr "3. 制御ユニタリ演算 {#3-controlled-unitary-operations}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We need to introduce the controlled unitary $CU$ that applies the unitary operator $U$ on the target register only if its corresponding control bit is $|1\\rangle$. Since $U$ is a unitary operator with eigenvector $|\\psi\\rangle$ such that $U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$, this means:\n"
msgstr "対応する制御ビットが $|1\\rangle$ のときにのみ、ターゲットレジスタにユニタリ演算子 $U$ を適用する制御ユニタリ $CU$ を導入する必要があります。$U$ は固有ベクトル $|\\psi\\rangle$ を持つユニタリ演算子であり、$U|\\psi \\rangle =e^{\\boldsymbol{2\\pi i} \\theta }|\\psi \\rangle$ を満たすため、次のようになります：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"U^{2^{j}}|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}U|\\psi \\rangle =U^{2^{j}-1}e^{2\\pi i\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle =\\cdots =e^{2\\pi i2^{j}\\theta }|\\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.2 Example: T-gate QPE {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"
msgstr "3.2 例：T ゲートの QPE {#32-example-t-gate-qpe}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Let's use $T$ gate as an example of QPE and estimate its phase $\\theta$.\n"
msgstr "QPE の例として $T$ ゲートを使い、その位相 $\\theta$ を推定してみましょう。\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle =\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"1 & 0\\\\\n"
"0 & e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0\\\\\n"
"1\\\\\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}\n"
"= e^\\frac{i\\pi}{4}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We expect to find:\n"
msgstr "期待される結果は次のとおりです：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "where\n"
msgstr "ここで\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle = e^{2i\\pi\\theta}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"We initialize $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert1\\rangle$ of the eigenvector of $T$ gate by applying an $X$ gate:\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"T|1\\rangle = e^{2i\\pi\\theta}|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
"$X$ ゲートを適用して、$T$ ゲートの固有ベクトル $\\vert\\psi\\rangle = \\vert1\\rangle$ を初期化します：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/2334e6e2-7ae2-4d4c-9014-3e6041f37ee7-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/2334e6e2-7ae2-4d4c-9014-3e6041f37ee7-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next, we apply Hadamard gates to the counting qubits:\n"
msgstr "次に、カウンティング量子ビットにアダマールゲートを適用します：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/9c020053-c369-4cc4-829e-72246d79f82c-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/9c020053-c369-4cc4-829e-72246d79f82c-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We perform the controlled unitary operations:\n"
msgstr "制御ユニタリ演算を実行します：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/0b3bedfc-be73-427d-9eed-22a2d7df60cd-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/0b3bedfc-be73-427d-9eed-22a2d7df60cd-0.avif)\n"

