# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We see we get one result (`001`) with certainty, which translates to the decimal: `1`. We now need to divide our result (`1`) by $2^n$ to get $\\theta$:\n"
msgstr "結果として `001` が確実に得られており、これは10進数で `1` に相当します。次に、$\\theta$ を求めるために結果（`1`）を $2^n$ で割ります：\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{2^3} = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
